# Red Tiger Mechan's warp {1}{R} (CR 702.185a): cast for its warp cost, paid with Moxen worth exactly that (one short, the warp
# cast is not offered, and the pool ends empty), it is exiled at the beginning of the next end step. It has haste, so it
# attacks for 3 first.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Red Tiger Mechan
Island x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x24

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Hand.Red Tiger Mechan.Cast(Ability: Warp; Mana: short)
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Red Tiger Mechan.Cast(Ability: Warp)
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Mana = 
Bot1.Attack(Red Tiger Mechan > Bot2)
[Bot1.End]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 17
Exile = Red Tiger Mechan
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Emerald; Mox Ruby
